WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.402
-After lying and claiming
he was unhappy

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:05.371
with the racist chants
he inspired last week,

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.374
the President is back
