00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.275
four Democratic Congresswomen
of color.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.411
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.945
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.415 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.550
Last week, after he incited

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.886
a crowd at his rally
to chant "Send her back"

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.388
about Minnesota Congresswoman
Ilhan Omar,

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.457
