which was obviously BS.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.432
It's like if Mr. Met started
pumping up a crowd at a game,

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:35.000
and then when they chanted
"Let's go, Mets,"

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.904
he said,
"Whoa, whoa, whoa, guys!

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:41.674
That is uncalled for!"

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.277
Donald Trump is not known
for disavowing racism.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.779
In fact, he won't disavow
anyone who supports

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:49.349
or praises him because
he's a raging narcissist.

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.717
He rails against communism,

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.186
but if Mao came back from
the dead and endorsed him,

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.555
Trump would start wearing tunics
the next day.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.023
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.391
We've been here before
countless times.

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.794
Like the time he repeatedly
refused to disavow

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:04.464
the support of former KKK leader
