00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:05.998
and then later lied and said

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:07.900
it was because he couldn't
hear the question.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.470
-He says, "I'm just talking
about David Duke

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.439
