00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.388
[ As Trump ] I'm here
in this house in Florida.

00:01:29.388 --> 00:01:31.891
I can't hardly hear
what you're saying.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:34.560
My ear trumpet is on the fritz."

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.596
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.432
[ Normal voice ] And then
there was Trump's reaction

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.467
