when he refused to condemn

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.236
neo-Nazis
and white supremacists.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.705
Two days later, Trump's advisors
again had to wrangle him

00:01:46.705 --> 00:01:49.341
