00:02:00.385 --> 00:02:01.654
Trump told his aides,

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.789
"That was the biggest [bleep]
mistake I've made.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:06.192
That's the worst speech
I've ever given."

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.661
You think that's the worst
speech you've ever given?

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:11.163
Dude, you've given speeches
