while sitting in office.

00:04:24.697 --> 00:04:26.165
-That's right.
Trump can't be indicted

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:28.567
because of a memo
written in 1973.

00:04:28.567 --> 00:04:30.969
People ignore memos every day.

00:04:30.969 --> 00:04:32.638
We sent out 15 memos,

00:04:32.638 --> 00:04:35.341
